# Build-context hygiene (Spec 008). The context is the repo root, so anything not excluded here
# is sent to the Docker daemon. Secrets, local state and bulky artifacts must never be.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
evals/reports
docs
frontend
infra/terraform
infra/k8s
node_modules
